    },
    {
      "section": "5.2.1",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9003]",
      "text": "OESA shall consist of a set of software subsystems that interact through a software connectivity backbone that is implemented in a software Subsystem called Common Software (CSW) layered on top of a physical communications network Subsystem called Communications and Information Systems (CIS) (see 'Figure: Observatory Software Architecture (OSA) Subsystem Decomposition').",
      "id": "REQ-1-OAD-9003"
    },
    {
      "section": "5.2.1",
      "label": "[REQ-1-OAD-9300]",
      "text": "Each OESA software subsystem shall consist of one or more lower-level software components.",
